 Main deck's Context card: each [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]question, its recommended (first-listed) option, the actual answer [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]when one exists, and how the round was answered (human via TUI, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Telegram, mobile, or CLI; automatic policy; agent; unknown). Data [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is projected from the existing question gate bundles, nothing new [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is written at settlement, and it works for every past gate-turn [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]round with no backfill.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]questions_main_deck.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/questions_main_deck.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1o5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1o5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the two latent shared question bugs[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]qa-bugs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]qa-bugs: stop build_merged_qa_markdown from dropping free-text answers [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and comments, and make option-less question rounds park for a human [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of crashing auto-resolution.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core question-round projection, binding, and Python read model[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-projection[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-projection: add the pure sase_core question_round projection and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its project_question_round binding in sase-core, then the sase facade, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed view dataclasses, and a cached single-bundle loader, committing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both repos in one turn.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rich presenter and GATE-phase swap for question gates[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]presenter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-projection[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]presenter: build the pure Rich Text presenter for question rounds and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]replace the raw Option JSON dump in question gates' GATE section and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]session Reply phases with it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Question-round scoping and the questions summary lane[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-projection[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane: add in-memory scoping of question gate rows for container, asking [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]turn, and gate row, zero-I/O first-paint stubs, and a new questions [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]DetailHeaderSummary lane with gate-state-keyed invalidation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mount the QUESTIONS section on the Context card[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]context-section[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presenter, lane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]context-section: render QUESTIONS on the Context card from stubs then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane data, with the session fold heading, de-duplicate the gate row's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]GATE section, and add header tests, a PNG snapshot, and a j/k perf [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reference docs and the questions skill sentence[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after context-section[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the QUESTIONS section and the question GATE phase in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Agents reference pages, and add one informational sentence to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase_questions skill source without deploying it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1o5","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1o5.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ed90fc0c22ddeb401f547bf2af2ae4d9","started_at":"2026-10-24T23:32:37.393815+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"d4709d10a075fd80a50ae7e008f2654ad95f110a62c8e93ee86733d4d2538069","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1o5.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"a958e8969605ac2f745ce63bdf5dc378c49feba6565ae263da0eece815f0ff1e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1o5.5/meta.json","size_bytes":687},"prompt":{"digest":"3d3ad2416106137cf41e4802f72e850be0c96e45c88adfde05bdf8c4fabc2bb9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1o5.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":194},"state":{"digest":"f5b65d2d3bec72da65bbf52a21724fdb2403bbc922162d11d0256ca7a846fa42","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1o5.5/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1o5.5","local_name":"sase-1o5.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1o5","agent_clan_generation":"20261024193105","bead_id":"sase-1o5.5","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1o5","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"s